[Music]  with the total of 24 characters  Dragonball Fighters has a sizable roster  that will satisfy fans needs for some  classic Dragon Ball moments but we could  always use more bandai namco has  announced eight DLC characters coming in  the future and while they haven't  officially announced who they are yet  after all rumors are still rumors  we can still speculate on who we would  want to see fighting alongside Vegeta  Gohan and the rest of the game so here  are our picks for the Dragon Ball  characters that we want to see in the  game  [Music]  Dragonball Fighters roster is full of  Dragonball Z and super characters but it  could use more from the original  Dragonball launch is one of the more  memorable ones one minute she's a blue  haired homemaker and the next she's an  aggressive blonde  sounds like a Super Saiyan all it takes  is one sneeze which would actually make  for a pretty cool dramatic intro and  while it might seem odd to see a  character whose arsenal mainly consists  of machine guns and rocket launchers it  definitely won't be the first for Bandai  Namco  [Music]  every fighting game needs at least one  character that switches things up in an  interesting way as a galactic patrolman  sworn to protect universe 7 Jocko has  has fair share of bizarre adventures  throughout the galaxy occasionally  crossing paths with the Z fighters he  may be a bit timid but this space cop is  also a pretty skilled fighter with a  number of high-tech gadgets at his  disposal armed with a ray gun jet boots  bombs and other tools  Jaco could be a welcome change of pace  from the other characters on fighter's  roster  [Music]  Goku's childhood mentor may have since  been eclipsed by his former pupils but  as Dragon Ball super proves the wily  turtle hermit can still hold his own in  the fight thanks to his deep bag of  tricks what Master Roshi lacks in  strength compared to the other fighters  he more than makes up for an experience  and should he make an appearance in  Dragon Ball fighters we'll hopefully see  some of his special techniques like  Thunder shock surprise or the evil  containment wave  [Music]  as the reigning World Martial Arts  champion mr. Sutton is known far and  wide for his superhuman skill and  strength well at least to his fans while  his powers aren't on the same level as  Goku or Vegeta he can still hold his own  against a couple of phone books  hey actually be a pretty cool super and  unlike most of the cast and fighters he  can't fly or use energy attacks which  might regulate him to hand-to-hand  combat mostly and could really make for  an interesting play style  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]  Goku's older brother Raddatz was the  first major villain introduced in Dragon  Ball Z arriving to earth ahead of his  fellow sans nappa and Vegeta and handily  defeating Goku in battle while he only  appeared in the series for a very brief  time he was still an important character  in the Saiyan saga if only because he  revealed the truth behind Goku's origins  and set the stage for a much bigger  battle Raddatz may pale in comparison to  the other scenes right now but he was a  memorable villain who deserves a spot on  the Dragon Ball fighters roster  [Music]  like their sons Goten and Trunks Goku  and Vegeta had fused together on several  occasions and depending on what method  they use they become either Vegeta or  Gogeta both are extraordinarily powerful  fighters worthy of a spot on the  Dragonball fighters roster but as Vegeta  played a major role in both Dragonball Z  and Dragon Ball super la Gogeta appeared  in a film in the non-canonical Dragon  Ball GT he seems to be the more likely  of the two fused warriors to make the  cut  even as a small boy Goku has shown to  have incredible strength and fighting  skills so naturally his younger  iteration could be a great addition to  Dragonball Fighters along with his  signature Kamehameha kid Goku knows a  variety of different techniques that his  older self rarely uses anymore like the  solar flare and afterimage techniques  which would actually make his moveset  unique from his adult counterpart he can  also wield his childhood weapon the  power pole to help compensate for his  shorter reach  [Applause]  [Music]  universe sixes collie flaw has the honor  of being the first female Super Saiyan  she's unique in that she concentrates  her key in her back to transform rather  than relying on intense emotions and she  achieved Super Saiyan one and two very  quickly in Dragon Ball super Kali flaw  could appear in Dragonball fighters in  tandem with her protégé kale kind of  like Android 18 and 17 plus she promised  to give Goku a proper beating someday  what better place than in an Arc System  Works fighter so those are the  characters that we are hoping to see in  Dragonball fighters there are so many  more to choose from and who knows just  how many bandai namco will eventually  add into the game so let us know in the  comments who you'd like to see have  added in as DLC and don't forget to  check out GameSpot calm for more  Dragonball Fighters news features and  our full review of the game my name is  Joey  and thanks for watching

